<title>USA: Deals ignite Wall St trading, MCI tops list.</title>
<headline>Deals ignite Wall St trading, MCI tops list.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCI Communications Corp shares soared to the top of the Nasdaq most actives list early Monday in trade ignited by MCI's roughly $20 billion deal to merge with British Telecommunications Plc.</p>
<p>In the first 45 minutes of trade, MCI shares were up 1/2 to 30-3/4 as more than 11.5 million shares traded, more than four times the stock's average daily volume.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, British Telecom's American Depositary Receipts soared 5-1/2 to 61 after 250,000 shares traded, about four times the daily average.</p>
</text>
